config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBRTSP_CLIENT
    bool "RTSP Client Library"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_LIVE555
    help
        This option enables the RTSP Client Library, which pulls H.264/H.265
        video and G.711 audio from an RTSP server and hands it to the
        application through callbacks.  It can also talk back over an ONVIF
        audio back channel.  It depends on the LIVE555 library.

        Note: unlike BR2_PACKAGE_LIB_RTSPSERVER next door, this symbol is
        named the way buildroot derives it from the directory name, so
        setting it in a defconfig is enough to build the library on its own.
